    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1003">

                <pb facs="0937" n="929" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg929"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.24/220</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Lend-Lease Administrator</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stettinius</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Assistant Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Acheson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-12">December 12, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Dean</hi>: With further reference to your letter
                    of November 25,<anchor n="14" xml:id="d1003-f1"/> I am pleased to enclose for
                    your information a complete report on Lend-Lease aid to Turkey, indicating all
                    steps taken in that direction since the passage of the Act on March 11.</p>
                <p>You will note this report contains in addition to information on the points you
                    raised background and general material. It does contain, <pb facs="0938" n="930"
                        xml:id="pg930"/> however, everything which you asked for, and as this
                    complete report was available I felt that sending it to you in this form would
                    be the best answer to your inquiry.</p>
                <p>With best wishes,</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. R. Stettinius, Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1003-a1.xml" xpointer="d1003-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1003-f1" n="14" xml:id="d1003-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it asked information as to the quantities, dollar values, and
                    transfer dates of lend-lease aid which had been furnished to Turkey since the
                    passage of the Lend-Lease Act (867.24/199).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
